ke sure they are as expected. Edit the file again if necessary."}], "role": "tool", "tool_call_id": "call_gQzmUIbCyPlzSqc5jLBKW4KJ", "name": "str_replace_editor"}, {"content": [], "role": "assistant", "tool_calls": [{"id": "call_Kddf6uK3I5ss4qIxRrzmCEXg", "type": "function", "function": {"name": "execute_bash", "arguments": "{\"command\":\"ls -la tests | head -n 50\",\"timeout\":120,\"security_risk\":\"LOW\"}"}}]}, {"content": [{"type": "text", "text": "total 892\ndrwxr-xr-x 211 root root 12288 Jan 20 11:19 .\ndrwxr-xr-x  11 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 ..\n-rw-r--r--   1 root root   189 Jan 20 11:19 .coveragerc\n-rw-r--r--   1 root root   381 Jan 20 11:19 README.rst\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 absolute_url_overrides\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_autodiscover\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_changelist\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_checks\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_custom_urls\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_default_site\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_docs\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_filters\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_inlines\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_ordering\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_registration\ndrwxr-xr-x  12 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_scripts\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_utils\ndrwxr-xr-x   3 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_views\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 admin_widgets\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 aggregation\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 aggregation_regress\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 annotations\ndrwxr-xr-x   4 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 app_loading\ndrwxr-xr-x   5 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 apps\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 asgi\ndrwxr-xr-x   2 root root  4096 Jan 20 11:19 async\ndrwxr-xr-x   5 root root  4